    "explanation": "The family obtained a concrete hand surgery outpatient appointment within three days, assembled all records and medications into a packet, confirmed they will disclose diabetes only to the treating doctor, and explicitly named red-flag criteria requiring emergency action. The plan is safe, actionable, and traceable to the original surgical team.",
