      "explanation": "The doctor gently prompted the family to disclose diabetes by explaining its medical necessity and that only the treating team needs to know, not all relatives. However, the family initially offered only partial disclosure; the full disclosure was eventually negotiated, but the doctor's initial inquiry did not immediately secure complete supplementation of glucose or medication details. The trajectory shows the family eventually agreed to tell the doctor, but the discovery of withheld facts was not solely doctor-driven.",
